<item>
<title>黄之锋再被判囚10年；欧盟：法治状况恶化；学者：想关多久就多久香港高等法院11月5日以“串谋勾结外国势力”罪判处黄之锋监</title>
<link>https://t.me/OutsightChina/10464</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/OutsightChina/10464</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 02:48:14 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"><b>黄之锋再被判囚10年；欧盟：法治状况恶化；学者：想关多久就多久</b><br/><br/>香港高等法院11月5日以“串谋勾结外国势力”罪判处黄之锋监禁10年。法官认定黄与罗冠聪在国安法后继续寻求外国制裁，罪行重大；新刑期仅2个月2日与“47人案”同期执行，原定明年1月获释的黄料服刑至2036年。<br/><br/>港府称黄认罪是“有力震慑”，特首李家超指黄、罗等人是破坏香港繁荣稳定的祸首之一，外交部亦称黄“罪行严重”。欧盟则谴责判刑具政治动机，称香港法治正在恶化，美国国会及行政当局中国委员会称香港司法正被武器化。<br/><br/>据美联社报道，观察人士认为当局意在尽量延长知名活动人士的刑期；伦敦大学学者曾锐生对彭博社称，判决传递出北京可随意关押挑战者的信息。中大讲师孔永乐则对《联合早报》称判决在法理与量刑上合理。<br/><br/><a href="?q=%23%E6%94%BF%E6%B2%BB">#政治</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%89">#国安</a> <a href="?q=%23%E4%BA%BA%E6%9D%83">#人权</a> <a href="?q=%23%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF">#香港</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%9C%8B%E9%89%B4">#看鉴</a><br/><br/><i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png')"><b>🔗</b></i>原文链接<br/>《香港01》<a href="https://www.hk01.com/article/60385666" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">黄之锋承认串谋勾结外国势力 被判囚10年 官指属罪行重大</a><br/>《法庭线》<a href="https://thewitnesshk.com/%e9%bb%83%e4%b9%8b%e9%8b%92%e5%88%a4%e5%9b%9a10%e5%b9%b4-%e9%99%b8%e5%a7%94%e6%9c%83%e4%bf%83%e5%81%9c%e6%94%bf%e6%b2%bb%e6%bf%ab%e8%a8%b4-%e5%9c%8b%e9%9a%9b%e7%89%b9%e8%b5%a6%e7%b1%b2%e6%92%a4/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">陆委会促停政治滥诉 国际特赦吁撤销定罪 港府：恶意攻击抹黑</a><br/>《美联社》<a href="https://apnews.com/article/hong-kong-joshua-wong-sentencing-national-security-f4b08dd23bab9912569e5cabd990c1ef" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">Hong Kong activist Joshua Wong sentenced to 10 more years in prison（香港社运人士黄之锋再被判囚10年）</a><br/>《彭博社》<a href="https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-05/hong-kong-sentences-activist-joshua-wong-to-10-years-in-prison" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">Hong Kong Sentences Activist Joshua Wong to 10 Years in Prison（香港判处社运人士黄之锋10年监禁）</a><br/>《联合早报》<a href="https://www.zaobao.com.sg/news/china/story20261105-9954790" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">黄之锋勾结外国势力罪追加10年监禁 出狱时或已40岁</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/iLeIWz9eMgpx81x4M3LhT5sRJyEC7GJ4_mvFGKephWwTxnljSAI981e_kHz9WAt4qRqoqmRrm3mo6tvDs6Uy806xl_2rcxK8yFg4GdB1791_t9aUFO2XPSa4RU2NdyMmOhrobybiJcL4GguY4TGkdc3Do_WZgqcENHF0ZVmmwkh8UH7ctl_b8BKSxvidwzLAKFqUUG2k50qVw0mxJ62lAtQQ-JVIOYRkczK8tUtgxdca8hsINR6cCHoB9KLd6kJCs-yQ6MnGQwbDQefbUwqlMqQ-opgO0HXnc-X97Q7h6zHKL4ld9IbzmioP6BjXHYu7W0lWX40FuLj5eGm1sLLWeg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/HI-SMwq356Lsh-SRUM3vdtKjpt6qdAqSCeRD37WQ1DmIASgGLMbbzvQnmTxhnJkUW0Nu0xB5yTEXpByPbFhIVeCM31YTXcCCMPHaV0XlD2InuvsMRzXiBo0dykx1ub1EmctVsmYPLsnJFbt-M8_ZvtMsZqRs1mKzUP8lk21DX9qO3o1_6NEX4ZxPiTtTDEznltoWjDe7w56ldKlax-ZWAWb8wulW3Kr-8VGfB5GTUmkhAmvkr8M6rkOSffUKjPtf6tYbzeuIhj1inuhrrh1EnI58BUXoyaOPpv3SM9it03YWD1oK_3FhwdS-BPS3PCuakcBzn89ciN0IhExt9nKfsA.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/VnqvPlVSyAeVBz8IiQOvK52IRcQCwW3xgexaRPBdJOcuHvc0fZnHoqPfiWiQJ_P8DAKm6fQZg0tvgjDJ74dHx5oPrXVyqRKrlt80ez_hwAgsVtTmHiylhBFtYym0pJHyEl--Aea-uvvs02-aSFlPisNkAZ_yqP3WeBiBkgoEnN-uZhQuBeOClzKnXUm0rrXqkMGEVcjl3OOfFRGm26fedK8ZSChBgzA-m65DfvCZLI4JtfOzQnlU1czN5x2MqI7gbfNwmaOdC6ZzVxIJBn_ISo4IG1kYmQnmS6kkMCSRWUqQW4xdvU3I8fxSwSkRgnPzVF037glIcxBV5bFQ66ju6A.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/e_43fy7EbTJ7muiz1UZencBj91A8L8vASvdwRPc-Qlct1awcAPzm9niMcsdpKz01gv4-YYaDbJijyWuHKcDL_OoKus-j4MXxOTT0TE6_VODIKnTLX4HKIhXwAp_6TCOUU-_fGbO6QlaKjZ2VxblBfa2S12ORCLdXxd5Vb3y89ZajwA_AyWp392CBAjb3QY6YIK_QAMCJXR_6sQ_lXbOZdU66iPlL7cgaXy6B-4F6r9RFWST4KFa5mXWbFnPRhdpFKG0bOPrBdYZ7HWZpP1avmaLig7bgzvd4JXg42bTIglBX3-8EUIee2f4HC7gbSelDo1u9voPHMILgeKWZtCDsLQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-refe